{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12402","headline":"奉和中书常舍人晚秋集贤院即事寄徐薛二侍御 · 钱起","name":"奉和中书常舍人晚秋集贤院即事寄徐薛二侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文星垂太虚，辞伯综羣书。\n彩笔下鸳掖，褒衣来石渠。\n典坟探奥旨，造化覩权舆。\n述圣鲁宣父，通经汉仲舒。\n窗明宜缥带，地肃近丹除。\n清昼删诗暇，高秋作赋初。\n露盘侵汉耸，宫柳度鵶疎。\n静对连云阁，晴闻过阙车。\n旧僚云出矣，晚岁复何如。\n海峤瞻归路，江城梦直庐。\n含毫思两凤，望远寄双鱼。\n定笑巴歌拙，还参丽曲余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}